  "assay_type": "Biochemical LIMK1 kinase-inhibition concentration-response assay",
  "system": "LIMK1 (P53667) with cofilin-2 as substrate; enzyme source, construct, purity, and cofilin-2 formulation are unresolved. CHEMBL1258633 is the test compound.",
  "readout": "ADP-Glo luminescence after ATP depletion and ADP detection, following the supplied kinase-detect card.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "card_id": "kinase-prepare",
      "instruction": "Prepare a 10-point, threefold CHEMBL1258633 dilution series from an assumed 100 uM top final concentration. Keep vehicle constant across compound and control wells and include vehicle, background, and reference controls. Use three independent experiments.",
