    "CHEMBL3227038",
    "CHEMBL1839797",
    "CHEMBL3217427",
    "CHEMBL1833960"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "The concentration series and replicate count are provisional design assumptions, not sourced parameters.",
    "No IC50 for CHEMBL1258633 is supplied or predicted; retained measurements concern other compounds and are contextual only.",
    "LIMK1 origin is unknown in the retained descriptions; enzyme construct, concentration, substrate and ATP concentrations, vehicle fraction, and temperature remain unresolved.",
    "The examples use Kinase-Glo, whereas the selected card specifies ADP-Glo; ADP-Glo volumes and incubation times require a separate validated procedure.",
    "A biochemical IC50 demonstrates inhibition under these assay conditions, not cellular viability or target-specific cellular causality.",
    "Compound aggregation, cofilin-2 or ATP dependence, and direct effects on luminescence could confound the fitted response and require the stated controls or follow-up testing."
  ]
